    "Lean_roles": "20 Lean files:11 new mathematical modules(T25four,T23seven),four selected P2 proof/namespace repairs,andfive original/reference archives. Not20freshproofmodules.",
    "P2_r4": "Four actual failed modules matched to26 R3 diagnostics,73 literal theorem headers/28 definitions/imports/data unchanged. Two selective open commands are the only nonproof byte exception, restoring four OriginalThirdTriangleMomentsSourceOnly names and OriginalThirdSortedHalfIntegralSourceOnly.SymmetricFullBox. The earlier headers did not elaborate, so no claim of equality to a prior successfully elaborated type. Existing r2/r3 repairs and8003B ABI unchanged. Prospective102=88ebbaseline+4r2+5r3+4r4+ABI; no compiler/kernel acceptance yet.",
    "FinitePi_plan": "An early same-job FinitePi-only pilot will use the original46e strict owned/serialized multiplicity comparison, both full types and transitive axioms under the genuine guard. Pilot success only permits original102-module build and full-environment audit; it is not full102 acceptance and does not replace later FinitePi ownership audit. Failures get early lightweight logs before full retention. The plan is static here; no new actual driver or CI dispatched.",
    "T25_tail": "Four new modules prove fixed m!=0 nonnegative B_m(d) uniformly dominates all second integer frequencies and unit twists, and sum B_m(d)d^(-2+delta)<infinity for delta<1/4. Prime fourth moment and actual CRT suffice; prime powers k>=2 use only trivial bounds. No composite pointwise3/4 claim or stationary/Weil project. OriginalGamma0(z)infinity/1 positive frequencies C=d sqrtz,J1 geometric series absolutely converges with tailO(D^-delta) for0<delta<1/4 and physicalsqrt(mh)/z factor. Hecke/Petersson/Kuznetsov identity remain separate.",
    "T23_primebox": "Seven new modules use genuine ordered prime words excluding p|N, actual root/cell Q and original singular/phi normalization; fix mesh/epsilon,then n,then N0(n),simultaneously all original depth<=440 programs/cells/401atoms/both roots and polarities. Arbitrary shared bounded mark and each single additive-prime frozen carrier ell are covered with uniform ell,m threshold. Aggregate all-ell original receiver card, independently reselected winner/adopted, relative-to-own-Theta and whole430+11 remain open. The emitted-position mark<=1 does not bound mark times original lane.card; multiplying Theta again would be wrong.",
    "T23_read_provenance": "After the seven-source freeze the author reported one additional wrong-repository manuscript-SHA read triggering a failed read-only promisor upload-pack with not-our-ref and no obtained objects/remote writes. Root then prohibited further Git calls by this author. Independently reviewed frozen source hashes and reviewer evidence remain unchanged; a separate supplement is pending.",
    "preserved": "No original yellow or green duties promoted; default branch, original dirty continuation and paused P automations protected. No local Lean/Lake/LSP/stage/producer/proof execution."
  },
